# Secrets / local config
*.xcconfig.local
.env

# A local rulebook corpus for scripts/lint-reference.sh. The book is the copyrighted
# document CLAUDE.md rule 8 is about: the lint reads one from outside the tree, and this
# is here so a convenient local copy cannot be committed by accident.
/.rulebook.txt
/rulebook.pdf

# The two filenames scripts/fetch-rulebook.sh writes, unanchored. That script refuses to
# write inside a checkout, so this should never fire; it is here because "should never"
# and "cannot" are different, and the failure mode is committing a copyrighted document.
rulebook.pdf
rulebook.txt
